 need to fetch the file up front and put it in ",[295,346,347],{},"v-model","; the page decides on auth headers, POST and the like. Return a ",[295,350,351],{},"Blob"," to have the component save it under ",[295,354,339],{},", or return nothing if the page handled the download itself (for example by opening a new tab). While downloading, the button shows a spinner and ignores repeated clicks; throwing an error shows the download failed toast (requires ",[295,357,358],{},"UApp","), and the passed ",[295,361,362],{},"signal"," is aborted on unmount. With a local ",[295,365,182],{},", the local file is downloaded directly and ",[295,368,343],{}," is not called.",[292,371,372,373,377],{},"When the file name is truncated, hovering or keyboard focus shows the full name, or a long press on touch devices (see ",[374,375,217],"a",{"href":376},"\u002Fcomponents\u002Fhelper\u002Ftooltip#touch-long-press","); a long press does not open the file dialog.",[324,379],{"name":380},"file-existing",[305,382,384],{"id":383},"clearing","Clearing",[292,386,387,390,391,393,394,396,397,399,400,396,402,405,406,409,410,412],{},[295,388,389],{},"clear"," is on by default and shows a trailing clear button when there is a local ",[295,392,182],{}," or an existing attachment; it is hidden while disabled or loading. Clearing sets ",[295,395,347],{}," to ",[295,398,317],{}," and ",[295,401,339],{},[295,403,404],{},"''",", leaving the field completely empty so a new file can be selected. Bind the attachment name with ",[295,407,408],{},"v-model:file-name"," so the page can tell from ",[295,411,404],{}," that the user removed the existing attachment; when it is passed one-way, clearing still empties the field.",[292,414,415,416,419,420,423,424,427,428,432,433,437],{},"Pass ",[295,417,418],{},":clear=\"false\""," to disallow removal; it is off by default inside a ",[295,421,422],{},"required"," ",[295,425,426],{},"UFormField",", following the same rules as the ",[374,429,431],{"href":430},"\u002Fcomponents\u002Fchoice\u002Fselect-menu#clear-button","SelectMenu clear button",". To turn it off across the project, use the ",[374,434,436],{"href":435},"\u002Fgetting-started\u002Ftheme\u002Fcomponent-defaults#configurable-props","global defaults",".",[324,439],{"name":440},"file-clear",[305,442,444],{"id":443},"button-icons","Button icons",[292,446,447,450,451,454,455,458],{},[295,448,449],{},"select-icon"," is the select button shown when there is nothing to download, ",[295,452,453],{},"clear-icon"," is the clear button, and ",[295,456,457],{},"download-icon"," is the download button shown when the file can be downloaded.",[324,460],{"name":461},"file-icons",[305,463,465],{"id":464},"variants","Variants",[292,467,468,469,399,472,475,476,479,480,483,484,487,488,491,492,437],{},"Uses the ",[295,470,471],{},"variant",[295,473,474],{},"icon"," of ",[295,477,478],{},"UInput",". ",[295,481,482],{},"ShuoFile"," has no ",[295,485,486],{},"color"," or ",[295,489,490],{},"highlight","; the color and error border follow ",[295,493,426],{},[324,495],{"name":496},"file-variant",[305,498,500],{"id":499},"size-and-states","Size and states",[292,502,503,504,507],{},"When disabled, the clear button is hidden but an existing attachment can still be downloaded; while loading, a spinner replaces the trailing buttons and nothing can be used. See ",[374,505,102],{"href":506},"\u002Fcomponents\u002Foverview\u002Fcommon"," for the behavior shared by all states.",[324,509],{"name":510},"file-states",[300,512,514],{"id":513},"examples","Examples",[305,516,518],{"id":517},"with-form-validation","With form validation",[292,520,521,522,336,525,399,528,314,531,533],{},"Check required, type and size with Valibot's ",[295,523,524],{},"v.file",[295,526,527],{},"v.mimeType",[295,529,530],{},"v.maxSize",[295,532,321],{}," only affects the file dialog, and the schema is the real limit.",[324,535],{"name":536},"file-validation",[305,538,540],{"id":539},"uploading-after-selection","Uploading after sel